config MDIO_DM9000
	bool "Davicom DM9000 MDIO driver"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_DAVICOM_DM9000_MDIO_ENABLED
	depends on ETH_DM9000
	help
	  Enable the Davicom DM9000 MDIO driver. The controller reaches its
	  integrated PHY (and an optional external PHY) through the parent
	  MAC's EPCR/EPAR/EPDR registers.
